{"nodes": [{"id": "current_status_fe_glassmorphic_design_system", "label": "Glassmorphic Design System", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CURRENT_STATUS_FE.md", "source_location": "lines 42-83", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A single set of design tokens (pastel palette, 8/16/24px backdrop blur, 10-40px radii, diffuse-only shadows, semi-transparent borders) is defined once as CSS variables so every component reads from the same source and light/dark stay consistent. Dark mode re-bases glass on rgba(20,18,35,opacity) with adjusted blur and border opacity rather than inverting colors, because frosted surfaces lose definition on dark backgrounds."}, {"id": "current_status_fe_dashboard", "label": "Recruiter Dashboard Page", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "CURRENT_STATUS_FE.md", "source_location": "line 12", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "current_status_fe_pipeline", "label": "Candidate Pipeline Kanban Board", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "CURRENT_STATUS_FE.md", "source_location": "line 18", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Drag-and-drop over 8 status columns with real-time status updates, implemented with @dnd-kit, so recruiters move candidates through the recruitment workflow directly rather than editing a status field in a form."}, {"id": "current_status_fe_candidate_profile", "label": "Candidate Profile Page with AI Analysis Tab", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "CURRENT_STATUS_FE.md", "source_location": "line 17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "current_status_fe_authcontext", "label": "Frontend AuthContext", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "CURRENT_STATUS_FE.md", "source_location": "line 36", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Loads the 